{n}The Solitaire {d|Encyclopedia:Ch3_ZanniNotEnemy}bows theatrically{/d}.{/n}
"With embers glowing cupped in my two hands,
I bear them through the deluge to the hearth."

d32cea7b-9f3f-4067-b219-957d1caa20ab.pt:
